+Feature: Todo Management
+  As a user
+  I want to manage a todo list
+  So that I can track tasks I need to complete
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+    And there are no existing todos
+
+  Rule: Adding todos
+
+  Scenario: Add a new todo
+    Given the new-todo input is focused
+    When I type "Buy milk" into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then a new todo "Buy milk" appears in the list
+    And the new-todo input is cleared
+
+  Scenario: Trim whitespace from new todo
+    When I type "   Walk the dog   " into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then a new todo "Walk the dog" appears in the list
+
+  Scenario: Ignore empty todo
+    When I type "" into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then no new todo is added
+
+  Scenario: Ignore whitespace-only todo
+    When I type "   " into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then no new todo is added
+
+  Rule: Toggling todos
+
+  Scenario: Toggle a todo as completed
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title     |
+      | Buy milk  |
+    When I click the toggle for "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" gets class "completed"
+
+  Scenario: Toggle a completed todo back to active
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title     |
+      | Buy milk  |
+    And the todo "Buy milk" is completed
+    When I click the toggle for "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" does not have class "completed"
+
+  Scenario: Mark all as complete toggles all todos
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title       |
+      | Buy milk    |
+      | Walk dog    |
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all todos have class "completed"
+
+  Scenario: Mark all as complete updates when individual todos are toggled
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title       |
+      | Buy milk    |
+      | Walk dog    |
+    When I click the toggle for "Buy milk"
+    And I click the toggle for "Walk dog"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all unchecked when any todo is active
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title       |
+      | Buy milk    |
+      | Walk dog    |
+    And all todos are completed
+    When I click the toggle for "Walk dog"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
+
+  Rule: Deleting todos
+
+  Scenario: Delete a todo
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title      |
+      | Buy milk   |
+    When I click the destroy button for "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is removed from the list
+
+  Rule: Clear completed
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes all completed todos
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title       |
+      | Buy milk    |
+      | Walk dog    |
+    And the todo "Buy milk" is completed
+    When I click "Clear completed"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is removed from the list
+    And the todo "Walk dog" remains in the list
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is hidden when no todos are completed
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title     |
+      | Buy milk  |
+    Then the clear-completed button is not visible
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is shown when completed todos exist
+    Given the following todos exist:
+      | title     |
+      | Buy milk  |
+    And the todo "Buy milk" is completed
+    Then the clear-completed button is visible
